    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播： 小韦 小宝 二蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目三位e人主播聊聊自身性格特质及生活工作经验</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">0:17</a></span></strong><span> 主播介绍</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">1:37</a></span></strong><span> MBTI 简介</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">3:37</a></span></strong><span> 东北E人多</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">6:35</a></span></strong><span> 关于MBTI性格特质在职场中的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a></span></strong><span> J人 VS P人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;旅行中的性格体现</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;性格转变的过程 也是寻找本心的探索</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a></span></strong><span> 旅行中的乌龙</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">47:05</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;性格不同 思考问题的出发点也不同</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a></span></strong><span> N人 VS &nbsp;S人</span></p>]]></description>
